WEBVTT

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.582
A historian might tell you

00:03:00.606 --> 00:03:03.778
Sweden hasn't been in a national conflict
for about 200 years.

00:03:03.802 --> 00:03:06.082
Uganda is still struggling
with an insurgency

00:03:06.106 --> 00:03:07.973
in the north of the country.

00:03:09.331 --> 00:03:11.045
A musician might tell you

00:03:11.069 --> 00:03:15.363
that Uganda, the national anthem,
"Oh Uganda, Land of Beauty,"

00:03:15.387 --> 00:03:17.133
is one of the shortest in the world.

00:03:17.157 --> 00:03:19.696
In fact, so short,
it's often played more than once.

00:03:20.022 --> 00:03:23.582
I believe Swedes play theirs
and sing theirs for a little longer.

00:03:24.765 --> 00:03:26.654
But more seriously,

00:03:26.678 --> 00:03:28.916
Sweden and Uganda have made a commitment,

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.998
they have a common bond
and shared purpose,